flowchart LR
    subgraph ME[My Mac]
        S1[My agent session]
        M1[Per-session MCP link<br/>list · send · reply]
        C1[App core · Rust<br/>policy checks · local store · keys]
        U1[App window<br/>conversations · held for review]
        S1 -->|tool call| M1 --> C1
        U1 <--> C1
    end

    R[Relay server<br/>store and forward<br/>cannot read the encrypted body]

    subgraph PEER[Colleague's Mac]
        C2[App core<br/>policy checks]
        S2[Colleague's agent session]
        H[Check before each tool call<br/>blocks access outside the folder]
        C2 -->|delivered as a colleague's request| S2
        S2 -.->|on every tool use| H
        H -.-> C2
    end

    C1 <-->|encrypted message| R
    R <--> C2

    style C1 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    style C2 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    style R fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#fbc02d,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    style H fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
